{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:NuclearInteractions.QbetaTraceCounitConvergence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"NuclearInteractions.QbetaTraceCounitConvergence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.qbeta_is_trace_mass_difference","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.qbeta_is_trace_mass_difference","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/qbeta-trace-counit-convergence.lean#L49-L55","doc":"**Conditional corollary.** Granting the convergence conjecture, the\nphysical per-braid Markov-trace nucleon mass difference is exactly the\ncounit closed form. Fully verified modulo the single class instance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence.converges","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence.converges","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/qbeta-trace-counit-convergence.lean#L47-L47","doc":"**The conjecture**: the trace mass difference equals the counit form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence.counitForm_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence.counitForm_eq","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/qbeta-trace-counit-convergence.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Proved: the counit form is the closed rational expression in `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence.counitForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence.counitForm","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/qbeta-trace-counit-convergence.lean#L42-L42","doc":"The Frobenius-counit Q-value `ε(Δ)·𝔈₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence.traceMassDiff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence.traceMassDiff","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/qbeta-trace-counit-convergence.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Tower-summed Markov-trace nucleon mass difference `𝔪(n)−𝔪(p)−m_e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence.mk","kind":"ctor","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/qbeta-trace-counit-convergence.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaConvergence.QBetaTraceCounitConvergence","kind":"class","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/qbeta-trace-counit-convergence.lean#L32-L47","doc":"**Conjecture (Q_β trace–counit convergence).** The tower-summed\nMarkov-trace nucleon mass difference `traceMassDiff = 𝔪(n)−𝔪(p)−m_e`\nequals the Frobenius-counit closed form `counitForm = ε(Δ)·𝔈₀`. The\n`counitForm_eq` field records the *proved* closed form\n(`QBetaEnergyScale.Qbeta_closed`); the `converges` field is the\nconjecture proper. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:qbeta-trace-counit-convergence","label":"conj:qbeta-trace-counit-convergence","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/qbeta-trace-counit-convergence.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}